- **Supply: {supplyTotal} flats available.** The largest is in {topSupplyOkres} — {topSupplyN} flats, or {topSupplyShareEn} % of the city's entire offer.
- **Sales: {salesTotal} flats {periodEn}.** Most of them in {topSalesOkres} ({topSalesN} flats).
