- **Finished housing is a minority of the offer.** {supplyDone} flats sit in completed buildings, {supplyDoneShareEn} % of supply; {supplyBuildingShareEn} % is under construction, and for {supplyUnknownShareEn} % the developer publishes no completion date at all.

